WEBVTT

00:01:30.002 --> 00:01:32.463
Although wage theft impacts
many industries,

00:01:32.505 --> 00:01:35.383
my research focuses on one
of the most vulnerable sectors,

00:01:35.383 --> 00:01:36.759
day laborers,

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.970
most of whom are immigrants
from Latin America

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.888
who seek daily work for cash.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.933
You may have seen day laborers
at a worker center,

00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:47.228
outside a home improvement store
or on a street corner.

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:49.939
On a typical morning
at a street corner hiring site,

00:01:49.981 --> 00:01:51.274
trucks screech to a halt

00:01:51.315 --> 00:01:53.609
and employers yell out
how many workers they need

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:54.777
and the pay rate

00:01:54.819 --> 00:01:57.363
and workers rush
to the passenger-side window.

00:01:57.405 --> 00:01:59.991
Day laborers may just have
a couple of minutes